---
source: tests/golden/notifications.rs
expression: "norm::text(&out)"
---
provider: goalert (GoAlert)

## minimal config
{
  "server": "https://goalert.example.com",
  "token": "secret-token"
}

### down
POST https://goalert.example.com/api/v2/generic/incoming
(form)
token=secret-token
summary=Payments API is down
details=HTTP 503 (after 3 retries)
Target: https://pay.example/health
Type: HTTP(S)
Time: 2026-10-19 14:03:12 UTC
https://vv.example/monitors/7
dedup=vv-monitor-7

### up
POST https://goalert.example.com/api/v2/generic/incoming
(form)
token=secret-token
summary=Payments API is back up
details=down for 12m 4s
Target: https://pay.example/health
Type: HTTP(S)
Downtime: 12m 4s
Time: 2026-10-19 14:03:12 UTC
https://vv.example/monitors/7
dedup=vv-monitor-7
action=close

